{"steam_appid":3214610,"steam_name":"Cinderia","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1656678861/d5063d5edaabd69fb27426b29a9838d0b9a37ab4/1772786259/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772793452","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257298764/6f30cb4fc8dde0046300a18cf88ddb9721afa10d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772793452","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/150bdf433b7918ac8adc3359a450da9520d12516/ss_150bdf433b7918ac8adc3359a450da9520d12516.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782909383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/e63929fdbc88fe7a004cf9bef83d7fe3a29d2028/ss_e63929fdbc88fe7a004cf9bef83d7fe3a29d2028.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782909383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/8f81adfc5f08f55cdf1f1605d1e846dcfea77ecb/ss_8f81adfc5f08f55cdf1f1605d1e846dcfea77ecb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782909383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/a7d11bb346215ec5373947b467da70f484e0f93c/ss_a7d11bb346215ec5373947b467da70f484e0f93c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782909383","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/0c732963384544cdccc5e47a7ec2522ff6e7afb7/ss_0c732963384544cdccc5e47a7ec2522ff6e7afb7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782909383"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/67eb1df68348b8461ffaf51c316ae571.poster.avif?t=1782909383\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/67eb1df68348b8461ffaf51c316ae571.webm?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/67eb1df68348b8461ffaf51c316ae571.mp4?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash the Ash.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutal, high-speed action roguelite set in a dying dark fairytale world.<br>Weaponize the corruption. Break the limits. Burn your way through a kingdom reduced to ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9b5e0ed03f1ff6716fc83085da3c15c9.webp?t=1782909383\" width=421 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four distinct heroes. Four lethal playstyles.<br>Razor-sharp blades, heavy cannons, frost-forged power—every move hits hard, fast, and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight controls. Instant response.<br>Every fight is a test of skill—and a chance to dominate it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/583fafd5be98514232501ee7274c89d3.poster.avif?t=1782909383\" width=620 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/583fafd5be98514232501ee7274c89d3.webm?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/583fafd5be98514232501ee7274c89d3.mp4?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/afe8452fb1cd1e3e3eb87215f65133eb.webp?t=1782909383\" width=415 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where the game breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse Embers, Spellcards, and Legendary Gear into wildly overpowered builds.<br>Stack effects. Chain reactions. Push your setup beyond what should be possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different.<br>Every build can go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/5413cb1b5beee8d06ac39ff61b0ec633.poster.avif?t=1782909383\" width=620 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/5413cb1b5beee8d06ac39ff61b0ec633.webm?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/5413cb1b5beee8d06ac39ff61b0ec633.mp4?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/568ce1004ae7af33a14c8d65f49a4d51.webp?t=1782909383\" width=426 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Playable Heroes</strong> — each with 180+ skills to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>130+ Relics &amp; Gear</strong> — build, combine, and break the system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Runs</strong> — events, routes, and encounters shift every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Updates</strong> — new content, new systems, more ways to win</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/0215b12f53f7496a78bcef7383468471.poster.avif?t=1782909383\" width=160 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/0215b12f53f7496a78bcef7383468471.webm?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f0770d4a6cf0ca777b9f4c99d650138c.poster.avif?t=1782909383\" width=160 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f0770d4a6cf0ca777b9f4c99d650138c.webm?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/87f02472fdcac820b3ce406c763f8e68.poster.avif?t=1782909383\" width=160 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/87f02472fdcac820b3ce406c763f8e68.webm?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/298b129fefd7e0d3462eb6434911a42a.poster.avif?t=1782909383\" width=160 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/298b129fefd7e0d3462eb6434911a42a.webm?t=1782909383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5-12600KF<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16,384 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1066<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4096 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommend